{"id":"tafel","lemma":"Tafel","pos":"noun","rank":3524,"glosses":["panel, board (e.g., wooden panel)","table (raised dinner table or elevated long table, e.g., one at a banquet)","slab, tablet"],"ipa":"/ˈtaːfl̩/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/e/ea/De-Tafel.ogg/De-Tafel.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"Tafel","plural":"Tafeln"},"examples":[{"text":"Kannst du die Tafel sehen?","en":"Can you see the blackboard?","words":[{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"können"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"to see"}]},{"text":"Schau an die Tafel.","en":"Look at the blackboard.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/759277","words":[{"g":"to watch, to view","l":"schauen"},{"g":"at / on"},{"g":"the"},null]},{"text":"Tafeln sind nicht immer schwarz.","en":"Blackboards are not always black.","words":[null,{"g":"are","l":"sein"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"at all times without…"},{"g":"black"}]},{"text":"Ich werde es auf die Tafel schreiben.","en":"I'll write it on the blackboard.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/746743","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to become","l":"werden"},{"g":"it"},{"g":"on"},{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"to write, to write out"}]},{"text":"Was stand an der Tafel?","en":"What was written on the blackboard?","words":[{"g":"what"},{"g":"to stand","l":"stehen"},{"g":"at / on"},{"g":"the"},null]}]}